# arms/adult/loco/woman_r: the woman's right arm (bare below the chemise's puff sleeve)
# The arm library (P2b production, FOLK-BODY): her arms are bare below her garment's sleeve; every view carries regions (F
# forearm, H hand; U where the upper arm shows: the raised keys) so a jerkin's shirt sleeve or P2c gloves recolour it.
# Her keys: idle; walk D/U down down1 up up1, R/L B F N; run runF runB; lap; L lie; fling (the fall's recoil); guard
# (armR: the drawn weapon's ready guard, its `grip` mark where the man's is). A sleeve part on her arm channels draws them.
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role arms std
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys armR
side R

view D key down origin 1 -4
mark handR 0 3
|qts
|qsr
|qsr
|qts
|qsr
|.qq
regions
|FFF
|FFF
|FFF
|HHH
|HHH
|.HH

